  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Entdecken Sie unsere Speisekarte mit den Skiern an den Füßen!\r\nAmerikaner, Panini, kalte Sandwiches, Crêpes, süße Panini.\r\n\r\nNur im Winter geöffnet"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Tired of skiing?\r\nLet's have a break at the Ski K faim\r\nTo please everyone, a lot of snacks are available such as Americans, paninis, cold sandwiches, crepes, sweet paninis.\r\n\r\nThe establishment is open in winter only.\r\n\r\nEquipment: Heated up terrace\r\n\r\nMeans of payment: CB, cheque, cash\r\nLanguages spoken: French, German\r\n\r\nAnimals are accepted"
    ],
    "it": [
      "Venite a scoprire il nostro menu con gli sci ai piedi!\r\nAmericani, panini, panini freddi, pancake, panini dolci.\r\n\r\nStabilimento aperto solo in inverno"
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Venez découvrir notre carte, les skis aux pieds!\r\nAméricains, panini, sandwiches froids, crêpes, panini sucrés.\r\n\r\nEtablissement ouvert uniquement en hiver"
    ],
    "es": [
      "Venga a descubrir nuestro menú con los esquís puestos\r\nAmericanos, panini, sándwiches fríos, tortitas, panini dulce.\r\n\r\nEstablecimiento abierto sólo en invierno"
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Gelegen aan de skipiste, ontdek onze kaart en menu’s!\r\nAmericain, panini's, verse sandwiches, pannenkoeken, zoete panini's.\r\nEnkel geopend in de winter."
    ]
  },
